#\#CIF_1.1
#
# Save frames (spec para. 6, 10, Appendix A <SaveFrame>): a
# partitioned collection of data items inside a data block, opened by
# save_<framecode> and closed by a bare save_. Save frames may not
# nest. A dictionary-style example with one save frame.
data_dict

_atom_site_label
;
The atom site label.
;

save_atom_site_label
 _atom_site_label_category   A
 _atom_site_label_type      String
 _atom_site_label_examples  'C1, C2, O1'
save_

_atom_site_occupancy
;
The site occupancy.
;
